OL,3,GNEWSAMurder-accused 'annoyed' about
OL,4,Afake Rolex, jury told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of murdering a student
OL,7,Fnear a university campus has told his
OL,8,Ftrial he was annoyed he had been given
OL,9,Fa fake Rolex watch.
OL,11,FHarper Dennis, 19, is on trial at
OL,12,FLeicester Crown Court, accused of the
OL,13,Fmurder of De Montfort University (DMU)
OL,14,Fstudent Khaleed Oladipo in Oxford
OL,15,FStreet, Leicester, on 3 February.
OL,17,FThe trial has heard the pair knew each
OL,18,Fother through online gaming, but the
OL,19,Ffriendship soured after an unsuccessful
OL,20,Fattempt by Dennis to sell a fake Rolex
OL,21,Fgiven to him by Oladipo.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
