OL,3,GNEWSAMurder-accused 'annoyed' about
OL,4,Afake Rolex, jury told
OL,5,
OL,6,FGiving evidence in his defence on
OL,7,FWednesday, Dennis said he was "fearful"
OL,8,Ffor his life when Oladipo approached
OL,9,Fhim with a knife, adding he was
OL,10,F"wrestling" to prevent the 20-year-old
OL,11,Ffrom stabbing him.
